`enum` declarations, exported or not, print keyword and name with a line range spanning the body; their members aren't listed.
== args
input/enum.ts
== file input/enum.ts
enum Color {
  Red,
  Green,
  Blue
}

export enum Status {
  Active = 'active',
  Inactive = 'inactive'
}
== stdout
input/enum.ts (10 lines)
[L1-L5] enum Color
[L7-L10] export enum Status
== stderr
== exit 0
